# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# coatdisc.part -- A textured disc, whose coat is a polygon of many points
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A disc 40 across and 10 thick along y, all of it textured VDI 3400
# Ref 30: seen from the front, the coat of its face is a polygon of more
# corners than any record had room for once.
materials materials
circle d 40 0 0 along y
extrude disc from 0 to 10 d
finish vdi30 any
